   "start": 0.0,
   "duration": 1.4,
   "text": "SlashZero",
   "y": -560,
   "fontSize": 112
  },
  {
   "x": 0,
   "bgColor": "#0b1a3a",
   "bgOpacity": 0.0,
   "bgPadding": 0,
   "outline": 10,
   "color": "#19c6b7",
   "fadeIn": 0.0,
   "fadeOut": 0.35,
   "start": 0.0,
   "duration": 1.4,
   "text": "14 GB. AND A KERNEL DRIVER.",
   "y": -420,
   "fontSize": 60
  },
  {
   "text": "This Steam demo is\nfourteen gigabytes. For a\nside-scrolling action\ngame.",
   "start": 0.0,
   "duration": 4.486,
   "fontSize": 42,
   "y": 560,
   "bgOpacity": 0.62
  },
  {
   "text": "And a hundred and sixty\nfive megabytes of it is\nvideo made for a phone.",
   "start": 4.736,
   "duration": 4.068,
   "fontSize": 50,
   "y": 560,
   "bgOpacity": 0.62
  },
  {
   "text": "Here's what it is.\nSlashZero, a 3D anime\naction roguelike from\nStreetlamp Studio. You\nplay a Timehacker.",
   "start": 16.054,
   "duration": 8.535,
   "fontSize": 42,
   "y": 560,
   "bgOpacity": 0.62
  },
  {
   "text": "You dash, vault and combo\nacross a collapsing\ncyberpunk timeline, and\nevery run you rebuild your\ncharacter out of\nblessings, fragments and\nchips.",
   "start": 24.839,
   "duration": 9.136,
   "fontSize": 42,
   "y": 560,
   "bgOpacity": 0.62
  },
  {
   "text": "Now the build. Unreal 5,\nand two hundred and eight\nBink videos inside it.",
   "start": 40.225,
   "duration": 5.427,
   "fontSize": 50,
   "y": 560,
   "bgOpacity": 0.62
  },
  {
   "text": "One folder called PC, one\ncalled Mobile. A hundred\nand three files each, and\nevery filename in one\nexists in the other.",
   "start": 45.902,
   "duration": 7.882,
   "fontSize": 42,
   "y": 560,
   "bgOpacity": 0.62
  },
  {
   "text": "So a PC player downloads a\nhundred and sixty five\nmegabytes of phone video\nthat nobody will ever show\nthem.",
   "start": 54.034,
   "duration": 6.863,
   "fontSize": 42,
   "y": 560,
   "bgOpacity": 0.62
  },
  {
   "text": "It also ships two entire\ncopies of Chromium. Four\nhundred and seventeen\nmegabytes of web browser.",
   "start": 61.147,
   "duration": 5.871,
   "fontSize": 42,
   "y": 560,
   "bgOpacity": 0.62
  },
  {
   "text": "Two real-time voice SDKs,\none from ByteDance and one\nfrom Tencent, in a game\nwith no visible\nmultiplayer.",
   "start": 67.268,
   "duration": 7.125,
   "fontSize": 42,
   "y": 560,
   "bgOpacity": 0.62
  },
  {
   "text": "And a signed kernel-mode\ndriver.",
   "start": 74.643,
   "duration": 2.083,
   "fontSize": 50,
   "y": 560,
   "bgOpacity": 0.62
  }
 ],
